::ingredients

(cream, milk) 200g
(tomato sauce) 150g
(pancetta) 100g
(olive oil) as needed
(onion) as needed
(paprica) as needed
(parsley, optional) as desired
# Method-only ingredients
(sugar) small pinch
(salt) as needed

::instructions

(onion) <cut, small pieces>
(pancetta) <cut, ~1cm cubes>
{base} = (onion) + (pancetta)
{base} <fry, low fire, until onion darkens>
{sauce} = {base} + (cream) + (tomato sauce)
{sauce} <stir>
    + (sugar) <add>
    + (salt) + (paprica) <season>
Optional [
    {sauce} + (parsley)
]
{sauce} <cook, low fire, stirring slowly, 10m or until thickened>

::story

Fumé is a sauce for pasta (/pasta), typical of central Italy.
It is intended to be used in great amounts.

